---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="更新日志&共创致谢">
  <article class="changelog-page">
    <header class="page-header">
      <h1>📋 更新日志 & 共创致谢</h1>
      <p class="intro">记录网站的每一次成长与完善</p>
    </header>

    <div class="content-grid">
      <section class="card thanks-card">
        <div class="card-header">
          <span class="card-icon">🤝</span>
          <h2>集思共创</h2>
        </div>
        <ul class="contributor-list">
          <li>
            <span class="contributor-badge">@秋风吹落叶</span>
            <span class="contribution">提供微博书和喜马拉雅链接</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="contributor-badge">@younijiok</span>
            <span class="contribution">网站主题色变为东哥喜欢的蓝色</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="contributor-badge">@younijiok</span>
            <span class="contribution">「打爆一切」游戏加上音效和东哥原声</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="contributor-badge">@Gaalgaal</span>
            <span class="contribution">加【投稿】栏目</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="contributor-badge">@Z-Hong</span>
            <span class="contribution">加【保时捷家书】</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="thanks-note">还有诸多宝贵建议，因前两天过于繁忙，记不得太多，恕不一一列举，谨致诚挚感谢 🌹</p>
      </section>

      <section class="card todo-card">
        <div class="card-header">
          <span class="card-icon">🚀</span>
          <h2>后续计划</h2>
        </div>
        <ul class="todo-list">
          <!-- <li>
            <span class="todo-status">📌</span>
            <span>增加「球迷等级考试」趣味栏目</span>
          </li> -->
          <li>
            <span class="todo-status">📌</span>
            <span>补充各部分内容</span>
          </li>
                    <li>
            <span class="todo-status">📌</span>
            <span>随时吸纳建议和意见</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="contact-note">
          欢迎提出宝贵意见 👉 <a href="mailto:kkjusdoit@gmail.com">kkjusdoit@gmail.com</a>
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <section class="timeline-section">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-icon">✅</span>
        <h2>更新时间线</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline">
        <div class="timeline-item latest">
          <div class="timeline-marker"></div>
          <div class="timeline-card">
            <div class="timeline-date">
              <span class="date">2026-01-17</span>
              <span class="tag new">最新</span>
            </div>
            <h3>添加樊振东相关采访视频合辑</h3>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <div class="timeline-marker"></div>
          <div class="timeline-card">
            <div class="timeline-date">
              <span class="date">2026-01-16</span>
            </div>
            <h3>生日倒计时添加繁星共创活动</h3>
            <ul class="update-list">
              <li>首页生日倒计时添加「繁星共创」微博活动引导</li>
              <li>「丹忱破浪，星耀重关」—— 1月22日小胖29岁生日</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <div class="timeline-marker"></div>
          <div class="timeline-card">
            <div class="timeline-date">
              <span class="date">2026-01-15</span>
            </div>
            <h3>新增球迷来信</h3>
            <ul class="update-list">
              <li>新增《我的朋友樊振东》by BinwayQ</li>
              <li>主页精选投稿区域更新</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <div class="timeline-marker"></div>
          <div class="timeline-card">
            <div class="timeline-date">
              <span class="date">2026-01-14</span>
            </div>
            <h3>语录内容补充</h3>
            <ul class="update-list">
              <li>微博合辑添加微博书链接</li>
              <li>新增喜马拉雅语录合辑</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <div class="timeline-marker"></div>
          <div class="timeline-card">
            <div class="timeline-date">
              <span class="date">2026-01-13</span>
            </div>
            <h3>内容补充 & 界面优化</h3>
            <ul class="update-list">
              <li>补充投稿内容</li>
              <li>网站色调更换</li>
              <li>投稿加英文版</li>
              <li>天际樊星界面加上繁星点点背景</li>
              <li>修复了个别bug</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <div class="timeline-marker"></div>
          <div class="timeline-card">
            <div class="timeline-date">
              <span class="date">2026-01-12</span>
            </div>
            <h3>英文版本上线 & 投稿栏目</h3>
            <ul class="update-list">
              <li>英文版本上线</li>
              <li>增加投稿栏目</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <div class="timeline-marker"></div>
          <div class="timeline-card">
            <div class="timeline-date">
              <span class="date">2026-01-11</span>
            </div>
            <h3>根据樊星们的建议完善内容</h3>
            <ul class="update-list">
              <li>去除"贵人朋友"栏目</li>
              <li>去除"自媒体"条目</li>
              <li>增加"保时捷家书"</li>
              <li>优化"打爆一切"游戏体验</li>
              <li>增加"庆祝动作人传人现象"</li>
              <li>其他细节更正</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item first">
          <div class="timeline-marker"></div>
          <div class="timeline-card">
            <div class="timeline-date">
              <span class="date">2026-01-10</span>
              <span class="tag launch">🎉 上线</span>
            </div>
            <h3>网站正式上线</h3>
            <p class="launch-desc">樊振东互联网档案馆正式发布，包含职业生涯、语录与梗、贵人与朋友、评价与祝福、媒体链接、天际樊星、孤勇者七个页签</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="back-link">
      <a href="/about">← 返回关于页面</a>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .changelog-page {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2rem 1rem;
  }

  .page-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .page-header h1 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e88e5, #64b5f6);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
  }

  .intro {
    color: #888;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  /* 卡片网格布局 */
  .content-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .card {
    background: linear-gradient(145deg, #ffffff, #f8fafc);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(30, 136, 229, 0.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(30, 136, 229, 0.1);
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
  }

  .card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(30, 136, 229, 0.15);
  }

  .card-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.75rem;
    border-bottom: 2px solid rgba(30, 136, 229, 0.1);
  }

  .card-icon {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }

  .card-header h2 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: #1e88e5;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* 贡献者列表 */
  .contributor-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .contributor-list li {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    padding: 0.75rem;
    background: rgba(30, 136, 229, 0.05);
    border-radius: 10px;
    transition: background 0.2s ease;
  }

  .contributor-list li:hover {
    background: rgba(30, 136, 229, 0.1);
  }

  .contributor-badge {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: #1e88e5;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .contribution {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #555;
  }

  .thanks-note {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    padding-top: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px dashed rgba(30, 136, 229, 0.2);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #888;
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* 待办列表 */
  .todo-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .todo-list li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: 0.75rem;
    background: rgba(30, 136, 229, 0.05);
    border-radius: 10px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #555;
  }

  .todo-status {
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .contact-note {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    padding-top: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px dashed rgba(30, 136, 229, 0.2);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #888;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .contact-note a {
    color: #1e88e5;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .contact-note a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  /* 时间线部分 */
  .timeline-section {
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .section-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .section-icon {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }

  .section-header h2 {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    color: #1e88e5;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .timeline {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 2.5rem;
  }

  .timeline::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 8px;
    top: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    width: 3px;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #1e88e5, #90caf9);
    border-radius: 3px;
  }

  .timeline-item {
    position: relative;
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .timeline-item:last-child {
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }

  .timeline-marker {
    position: absolute;
    left: -2.5rem;
    top: 0;
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    background: #1e88e5;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 4px solid #fff;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(30, 136, 229, 0.3);
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .timeline-item.latest .timeline-marker {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e88e5, #42a5f5);
    animation: pulse 2s infinite;
  }

  .timeline-item.first .timeline-marker {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffd700, #ffb300);
  }

  @keyframes pulse {
    0%, 100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(30, 136, 229, 0.3); }
    50% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 6px rgba(30, 136, 229, 0.15); }
  }

  .timeline-card {
    background: linear-gradient(145deg, #ffffff, #f8fafc);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.25rem;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
    border: 1px solid rgba(30, 136, 229, 0.1);
    transition: transform 0.2s ease;
  }

  .timeline-card:hover {
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }

  .timeline-date {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .timeline-date .date {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #1e88e5;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .timeline-date .tag {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 20px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .tag.new {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e88e5, #42a5f5);
    color: white;
  }

  .tag.launch {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffd700, #ffb300);
    color: #333;
  }

  .timeline-card h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: #333;
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem 0;
  }

  .update-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .update-list li {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: #666;
    background: rgba(30, 136, 229, 0.08);
    padding: 0.3rem 0.6rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }

  .launch-desc {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #666;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .thanks-inline {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #888;
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    padding-top: 0.5rem;
    border-top: 1px dashed rgba(30, 136, 229, 0.2);
  }

  .back-link {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .back-link a {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    color: #1e88e5;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 500;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 25px;
    background: rgba(30, 136, 229, 0.08);
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .back-link a:hover {
    background: rgba(30, 136, 229, 0.15);
    transform: translateX(-4px);
  }

  /* 暗色模式 */
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    .page-header h1 {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #64b5f6, #90caf9);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      background-clip: text;
    }

    .intro { color: #aaa; }

    .card {
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #1a2a3a, #152535);
      border-color: rgba(100, 181, 246, 0.2);
    }

    .card-header {
      border-bottom-color: rgba(100, 181, 246, 0.2);
    }

    .contributor-list li,
    .todo-list li {
      background: rgba(100, 181, 246, 0.1);
    }

    .contributor-list li:hover {
      background: rgba(100, 181, 246, 0.15);
    }

    .contribution,
    .todo-list li {
      color: #ccc;
    }

    .thanks-note,
    .contact-note {
      color: #999;
      border-top-color: rgba(100, 181, 246, 0.2);
    }

    .timeline-card {
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #1a2a3a, #152535);
      border-color: rgba(100, 181, 246, 0.2);
    }

    .timeline-card h3 { color: #eee; }

    .update-list li {
      background: rgba(100, 181, 246, 0.15);
      color: #bbb;
    }

    .launch-desc { color: #bbb; }

    .thanks-inline { color: #999; }

    .timeline-marker {
      border-color: #1a2a3a;
    }

    .back-link a {
      background: rgba(100, 181, 246, 0.15);
    }

    .back-link a:hover {
      background: rgba(100, 181, 246, 0.25);
    }
  }

  /* 移动端适配 */
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .page-header h1 {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
    }

    .content-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .timeline {
      padding-left: 2rem;
    }

    .timeline-marker {
      left: -2rem;
      width: 16px;
      height: 16px;
    }

    .update-list {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }
</style>
